{
  "mn7:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 7 ",
  "mn7:0.2": "Vatthasutta ",
  "mn7:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn7:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn7:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn7:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn7:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn7:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn7:2.1": "“Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, vatthaṁ saṅkiliṭṭhaṁ malaggahitaṁ; ",
  "mn7:2.2": "tamenaṁ rajako yasmiṁ yasmiṁ raṅgajāte upasaṁhareyya—yadi nīlakāya yadi pītakāya yadi lohitakāya yadi mañjiṭṭhakāya durattavaṇṇamevassa aparisuddhavaṇṇamevassa. ",
  "mn7:2.3": "Taṁ kissa hetu? ",
  "mn7:2.4": "Aparisuddhattā, bhikkhave, vatthassa. ",
  "mn7:2.5": "Evameva kho, bhikkhave, citte saṅkiliṭṭhe, duggati pāṭikaṅkhā. ",
  "mn7:2.6": "Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, vatthaṁ parisuddhaṁ pariyodātaṁ; ",
  "mn7:2.7": "tamenaṁ rajako yasmiṁ yasmiṁ raṅgajāte upasaṁhareyya—yadi nīlakāya yadi pītakāya yadi lohitakāya yadi mañjiṭṭhakāya—surattavaṇṇamevassa parisuddhavaṇṇamevassa. ",
  "mn7:2.8": "Taṁ kissa hetu? ",
  "mn7:2.9": "Parisuddhattā, bhikkhave, vatthassa. ",
  "mn7:2.10": "Evameva kho, bhikkhave, citte asaṅkiliṭṭhe, sugati pāṭikaṅkhā. ",
  "mn7:3.1": "Katame ca, bhikkhave, cittassa upakkilesā? ",
  "mn7:3.2": "Abhijjhāvisamalobho cittassa upakkileso, byāpādo cittassa upakkileso, kodho cittassa upa